  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN JRP SAFE plus II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension of the UN Joint Project to address cooking fuel needs, environmental degradation and food security for populations affected by the Rohinya Refugee crisis. It aims to address short, medium and longer-term challenges with activities benefitting both the refugee and the host community populations, and contributing to social cohesion.
Following the UN MPTFO operational modality, UNHCR Bangladesh (Convening Party) will implement the Project jointly with International Organisation for Migration (IOM), UN Food and Agricultural Organization (FAO) and World Food Programme (WFP).</narrative>
  </description>
